# oxfmt's Markdown parser currently corrupts literal identifiers and MDX
# comments in this repository. Keep prose byte-stable until that parser is safe.
**/*.md
**/*.mdx

# Agent skills are vendored from the canonical library (dzhng/skills); keep the
# whole tree byte-identical to source (incl. scripts/assets) — don't reformat.
.agents/skills/

# Official-agent seed content is authored, hashed, and replicated verbatim to
# the hub — the formatter reformatting a prompt or an app template rewrites what
# every installer receives, and breaks the manifest hashes.
packages/official-agents-seed/content/

# Generated code is owned by its codegen, not the formatter — never reformat it.
**/_generated/
**/*.generated.*
**/skills-registry/src/generated.ts
